==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|fagr|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|fo}} {{m|gem-pro|*fagraz}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|fo}} {{m|ine-pro|*ph₂ḱ-||to fasten, place}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfɛaːvʊɹ/|lang=fo}}
*: {{rhymes|ɛaːvʊɹ|lang=fo}}

===Adjective===
{{fo-adj|fagrari|fagrastur}}

# [[beautiful]], [[fair]], [[pulchritudinous]]
#: {{usex|'''fagrir''' [[litur|litir]]|t=beautiful colors|lang=fo}}
#: {{usex|[[allur|alt]] [[er]] [[í]] '''fagrasta''' [[lag]]i|t=all is in best order|lang=fo}}
# {{context|weather|lang=fo}} very good
#: {{usex|[[veður|veðrið]] [[var]] [[av]] [[tí]] '''fagrasta'''|t=the weather was of the best|lang=fo}}
# {{context|literature|lang=fo}} about [[fiction]]
#: {{usex|'''fagrar''' [[bókmentir]]|t=fiction|lang=fo}}

====Declension====
{{fo-decl-adj-29|f|a|g|ø}}

